      "repair_reason": "- [P1] The remaining blocker is contributor proof or maintainer acceptance of the proof gap, not a safe automated code repair.; Cleared: The diff only changes cleanup around an existing local lock file handle and does not touch secrets, dependencies, CI, package resolution, or code-execution surfaces. (sha=60dd632d98bb0f4aa0820c153c1ede3238a38ec9)",
      "review_summary": "The PR wraps post-open gateway lock payload writing so write failures close the acquired file handle, remove the partial lock file, and rethrow.\n\nPR surface: Source +8. Total +8 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. for source-level reproduction: make fs.open(\"wx\") succeed and make the returned FileHandle.writeFile reject on current main. The handle is then never returned to a release closure, so close and partial-lock cleanup are unreachable.",
