      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(gateway-lock): close fd when writeFile fails after acquiring lock",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n`fs.open(lockPath, 'wx')` acquired the lock file but `writeFile()` failure (disk full, etc) threw without closing the fd.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\nInner try-catch closes the handle and removes the partial lock file before re-throwing.\n\n## User Impact\nNo user-visible change. Prevents fd leak on disk errors during lock acquisition.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-98848-proof.png)\n- `gateway-lock.test.ts`: 16/16 passed ✅",
